/* Native caller contract: name, C type/width, Go configuration key, failure default.
 * Define CONFIG_NUMBER, CONFIG_STRING, CONFIG_INDEX_NUMBER and CONFIG_INDEX_STRING
 * before including. Defaults apply only when the config transport cannot answer.
 * Security gates keep their existing fail-closed defaults; Go owns stored defaults. */

